<title>USA: Wells Financial sets initial payout.</title>
<headline>Wells Financial sets initial payout.</headline>
<dateline>WELLS, Minn. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wells Financial Corp, the holding company of Wells Federal Bank FSB, said Monday it declared an initial quarterly cash dividend of $0.12 a share.</p>
<p>This is the first dividend since the company issued its stock on April 11, 1995.</p>
<p>Subject to the company's earnings and capital, the company said it currently intends to continue regular quarterly cash dividends.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
